  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Hats do nothing at all, and look good doing it. $(l)You$() can wear one, and so can your drones: a drone folds its antenna away and wears the hat on its tank, clear of every module."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(li)$(l)Wear a hat$(): right-click with it, or put it in your helmet slot.$(br)$(li)$(l)On a drone$(): right-click the drone with the hat.$(br)$(li)$(l)Take it off$(): right-click the drone with Shears.$(br2)A drone you pick up drops its hat. Armor stands can wear hats too."
    },
